  <script type="application/json" data-target="react-app.embeddedData">{"payload":{"preloaded_records":{},"structured_data":{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","headline":"Swarm stress test: three waves of simultaneous claim+submit across all 30 workers","articleBody":"Operator-run validation burst (direct hire, not an open call).\n\nGoal: measure how mainnet v3 and the Railway keeper behave when many workers transact at the same moment. Three waves of 10 workers each. Within a wave, every worker fires approve+claim+submit at the same instant (30 transactions in flight), the deployer resolves all 10 in parallel with explicit nonces, and the keeper has to digest 10 settleStake plus 10 attestReputation calls in its 5-minute tick.\n\n- Mode: postDirectHire, task type 10 (Custom), 1 CELO reward, 0.05 CELO stake\n- Wave 1: workers 11-20. Wave 2: workers 21-30. Wave 3: workers 1-10.\n- Every worker runs a fresh npm install of SDK 0.6.7 (the release that unified live Celo gas pricing across writes), so this doubles as install-to-earn validation at scale.\n- Per-wave bountyIds land in comments below.\n\nContext: today's ten sequential lifecycle runs (bounties 23-32) all closed unattended; this issue covers the parallel phase.","author":{"url":"https://github.com/yeheskieltame","@type":"Person","name":"yeheskieltame"},"datePublished":"2026-06-10T13:58:00.000Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"https://schema.org/CommentAction","userInteractionCount":6},"url":"https://github.com/497/claudelance/issues/497"},"best_match_sort_enabled":false,"issue_search_type":"ISSUE_HYBRID","preloadedQueries":[{"queryId":"19f2fbbccbf3127c7e6074aa2954c15e","queryName":"IssueViewerViewQuery","variables":{"count":15,"number":497,"owner":"yeheskieltame","repo":"claudelance"},"result":{"data":{"repository":{"id":"R_kgDOSctdaQ","isOwnerEnterpriseManaged":false,"owner":{"__typename":"User","userNameDisplayConfiguration":"HANDLE","id":"U_kgDOBwbFKQ"},"issue":{"id":"I_kwDOSctdac8AAAABFBWQZg","number":497,"viewerCanUpdateMetadata":false,"repository":{"id":"R_kgDOSctdaQ","databaseId":1238064489,"name":"claudelance","isArchived":false,"nameWithOwner":"yeheskieltame/claudelance","viewerCanInteract":false,"viewerInteractionLimitReasonHTML":"","slashCommandsEnabled":false,"visibility":"PUBLIC","viewerCanPush":false,"owner":{"__typename":"User","login":"yeheskieltame","id":"U_kgDOBwbFKQ","url":"https://github.com/yeheskieltame","databaseId":117884201,"issueFieldsEnabled":false,"issueFields":{"totalCount":0},"pinnedIssueFields":{"nodes":[]}},"isPrivate":false,"isWritable":true,"isOwnerEnterpriseManaged":false,"viewerCanPinIssues":false,"isCopilotAgentEnabled":null,"issueTypes":null,"pinnedIssues":{"totalCount":0},"viewerIssueCreationPermissions":{"triageable":false}},"updatedAt":"2026-06-12T16:27:03Z","titleHTML":"Swarm stress test: three waves of simultaneous claim+submit across all 30 workers","url":"https://github.com/yeheskieltame/claudelance/issues/497","viewerCanUpdateNext":false,"issueType":null,"duplicateOf":null,"linkedPullRequests":{"nodes":[]},"agentAssignments":[],"closedByPullRequestsReferences":{"nodes":[]},"labels":{"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":null},"edges":[]},"milestone":null,"assignedActors":{"nodes":[]},"locked":false,"viewerCanComment":false,"databaseId":4631924838,"state":"CLOSED","stateReason":"COMPLETED","title":"Swarm stress test: three waves of simultaneous claim+submit across all 30 workers","createdAt":"2026-06-10T13:58:00Z","viewerDidAuthor":false,"author":{"avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117884201?u=aa2944fa7b0e6d4ef4bd011064fde2748167095b\u0026v=4","login":"yeheskieltame","id":"U_kgDOBwbFKQ","profileUrl":"https://github.com/yeheskieltame","name":"Yeheskiel Yunus Tame","__typename":"User"},"body":"Operator-run validation burst (direct hire, not an open call).\n\nGoal: measure how mainnet v3 and the Railway keeper behave when many workers transact at the same moment. Three waves of 10 workers each. Within a wave, every worker fires approve+claim+submit at the same instant (30 transactions in flight), the deployer resolves all 10 in parallel with explicit nonces, and the keeper has to digest 10 settleStake plus 10 attestReputation calls in its 5-minute tick.\n\n- Mode: postDirectHire, task type 10 (Custom), 1 CELO reward, 0.05 CELO stake\n- Wave 1: workers 11-20. Wave 2: workers 21-30. Wave 3: workers 1-10.\n- Every worker runs a fresh npm install of SDK 0.6.7 (the release that unified live Celo gas pricing across writes), so this doubles as install-to-earn validation at scale.\n- Per-wave bountyIds land in comments below.\n\nContext: today's ten sequential lifecycle runs (bounties 23-32) all closed unattended; this issue covers the parallel phase.","bodyHTML":"\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eOperator-run validation burst (direct hire, not an open call).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eGoal: measure how mainnet v3 and the Railway keeper behave when many workers transact at the same moment. Three waves of 10 workers each. Within a wave, every worker fires approve+claim+submit at the same instant (30 transactions in flight), the deployer resolves all 10 in parallel with explicit nonces, and the keeper has to digest 10 settleStake plus 10 attestReputation calls in its 5-minute tick.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMode: postDirectHire, task type 10 (Custom), 1 CELO reward, 0.05 CELO stake\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWave 1: workers 11-20. Wave 2: workers 21-30. Wave 3: workers 1-10.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEvery worker runs a fresh npm install of SDK 0.6.7 (the release that unified live Celo gas pricing across writes), so this doubles as install-to-earn validation at scale.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePer-wave bountyIds land in comments below.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eContext: today's ten sequential lifecycle runs (bounties 23-32) all closed unattended; this issue covers the parallel phase.\u003c/p\u003e","bodyVersion":"7a2aa96123a2a59f239837f54523bbe2f4054c58c1ba89c5f1ac0345ccab8432","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"THUMBS_DOWN","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"LAUGH","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HOORAY","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"CONFUSED","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HEART","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"ROCKET","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"EYES","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}}],"pinnedIssueComment":null,"viewerCanAssign":false,"viewerCanLabel":false,"projectItems":{"edges":[],"pageInfo":{"endCursor":null,"hasNextPage":false}},"viewerCanSetMilestone":false,"isPinned":false,"viewerCanDelete":false,"viewerCanTransfer":false,"viewerCanConvertToDiscussion":false,"viewerCanLock":false,"viewerCanType":false,"viewerCanSetFields":false,"issueFieldValues":{"nodes":[]},"subIssuesSummary":{"total":0,"completed":0},"pendingSuggestions":[],"frontTimelineItems":{"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpPPAAABnryoi9gBqzI2Njg0NjgxOTQw"},"totalCount":9,"edges":[{"node":{"__typename":"IssueComment","databaseId":4672135229,"viewerDidAuthor":false,"issue":{"author":{"__typename":"User","login":"yeheskieltame","id":"U_kgDOBwbFKQ"},"id":"I_kwDOSctdac8AAAABFBWQZg","number":497,"locked":false,"databaseId":4631924838},"author":{"__typename":"User","login":"yeheskieltame","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117884201?u=aa2944fa7b0e6d4ef4bd011064fde2748167095b\u0026v=4","profileUrl":"https://github.com/yeheskieltame","id":"U_kgDOBwbFKQ","name":"Yeheskiel Yunus Tame"},"id":"IC_kwDOSctdac8AAAABFnsgPQ","url":"https://github.com/yeheskieltame/claudelance/issues/497#issuecomment-4672135229","createdAt":"2026-06-10T16:17:12Z","authorAssociation":"OWNER","viewerCanDelete":false,"viewerCanMinimize":false,"viewerCanUnminimize":false,"viewerCanReport":false,"viewerCanReportToMaintainer":false,"viewerCanBlockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanUnblockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanBlockPersonally":false,"viewerCanUnblockPersonally":false,"viewerCanPin":false,"viewerCanUnpin":false,"viaApp":null,"minimizedReason":null,"showSpammyBadge":false,"createdViaEmail":false,"authorToRepoOwnerSponsorship":null,"viewerCanReadUserContentEdits":true,"lastEditedAt":null,"lastUserContentEdit":null,"pinnedBy":null,"body":"Wave 1 posted: bounties 33-40 to workers 11-18. The 9th post (worker 19) reverted with 'transfer value exceeded balance of sender': on Celo the CELO ERC20 shares the native ledger, so the 500k-limit gas reservations on eight string-heavy postDirectHire calls (~0.13 CELO each at 405 gwei) drained the escrow budget below 1 CELO. Workers 19-20 fold into wave 2. Reverted tx: 0xa6a845f10e8a59f34cf0bbe397301c99979fdf6144c807fa05cb13dc5890c483","bodyHTML":"\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eWave 1 posted: bounties 33-40 to workers 11-18. The 9th post (worker 19) reverted with 'transfer value exceeded balance of sender': on Celo the CELO ERC20 shares the native ledger, so the 500k-limit gas reservations on eight string-heavy postDirectHire calls (~0.13 CELO each at 405 gwei) drained the escrow budget below 1 CELO. Workers 19-20 fold into wave 2. Reverted tx: 0xa6a845f10e8a59f34cf0bbe397301c99979fdf6144c807fa05cb13dc5890c483\u003c/p\u003e","bodyVersion":"6069c85ba747ab0878f45000bf3c5b97ac233b2ffa47b60dd1feb1c0cdd65225","isHidden":false,"viewerCanUpdate":false,"repository":{"id":"R_kgDOSctdaQ","name":"claudelance","owner":{"__typename":"User","id":"U_kgDOBwbFKQ","login":"yeheskieltame","url":"https://github.com/yeheskieltame"},"isPrivate":false,"viewerCanCreateIssues":false,"slashCommandsEnabled":false,"nameWithOwner":"yeheskieltame/claudelance","databaseId":1238064489},"reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"THUMBS_DOWN","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"LAUGH","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HOORAY","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"CONFUSED","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HEART","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"ROCKET","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"EYES","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}}],"__isNode":"IssueComment"},"cursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpPPAAABnrJSz0AAqjQ2NzIxMzUyMjk="},{"node":{"__typename":"IssueComment","databaseId":4672175878,"viewerDidAuthor":false,"issue":{"author":{"__typename":"User","login":"yeheskieltame","id":"U_kgDOBwbFKQ"},"id":"I_kwDOSctdac8AAAABFBWQZg","number":497,"locked":false,"databaseId":4631924838},"author":{"__typename":"User","login":"yeheskieltame","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117884201?u=aa2944fa7b0e6d4ef4bd011064fde2748167095b\u0026v=4","profileUrl":"https://github.com/yeheskieltame","id":"U_kgDOBwbFKQ","name":"Yeheskiel Yunus Tame"},"id":"IC_kwDOSctdac8AAAABFnu_Bg","url":"https://github.com/yeheskieltame/claudelance/issues/497#issuecomment-4672175878","createdAt":"2026-06-10T16:23:21Z","authorAssociation":"OWNER","viewerCanDelete":false,"viewerCanMinimize":false,"viewerCanUnminimize":false,"viewerCanReport":false,"viewerCanReportToMaintainer":false,"viewerCanBlockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanUnblockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanBlockPersonally":false,"viewerCanUnblockPersonally":false,"viewerCanPin":false,"viewerCanUnpin":false,"viaApp":null,"minimizedReason":null,"showSpammyBadge":false,"createdViaEmail":false,"authorToRepoOwnerSponsorship":null,"viewerCanReadUserContentEdits":true,"lastEditedAt":null,"lastUserContentEdit":null,"pinnedBy":null,"body":"Wave 1 burst result: 8 simultaneous claim+submit pipelines (workers 11-18, bounties 33-40) all landed in 10-13 seconds with zero failures. All 8 resolutions were sent back to back inside 24 seconds, and the Railway keeper digested the whole backlog in its next tick: settleStake plus attestReputation for all 8 between +94s and ~+150s after the first pickWinner, processed serially on its single nonce lane with no drops. Agents 9071-9078 each gained +1 ERC-8004 feedback.","bodyHTML":"\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eWave 1 burst result: 8 simultaneous claim+submit pipelines (workers 11-18, bounties 33-40) all landed in 10-13 seconds with zero failures. All 8 resolutions were sent back to back inside 24 seconds, and the Railway keeper digested the whole backlog in its next tick: settleStake plus attestReputation for all 8 between +94s and ~+150s after the first pickWinner, processed serially on its single nonce lane with no drops. Agents 9071-9078 each gained +1 ERC-8004 feedback.\u003c/p\u003e","bodyVersion":"1d86cdfcb2c360a2a7604d49f9677c440a3a36c512be00b48ab1e7fd5c7d82ec","isHidden":false,"viewerCanUpdate":false,"repository":{"id":"R_kgDOSctdaQ","name":"claudelance","owner":{"__typename":"User","id":"U_kgDOBwbFKQ","login":"yeheskieltame","url":"https://github.com/yeheskieltame"},"isPrivate":false,"viewerCanCreateIssues":false,"slashCommandsEnabled":false,"nameWithOwner":"yeheskieltame/claudelance","databaseId":1238064489},"reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"THUMBS_DOWN","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"LAUGH","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HOORAY","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"CONFUSED","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HEART","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"ROCKET","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"EYES","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}}],"__isNode":"IssueComment"},"cursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpPPAAABnrJYcKgAqjQ2NzIxNzU4Nzg="},{"node":{"__typename":"IssueComment","databaseId":4672245553,"viewerDidAuthor":false,"issue":{"author":{"__typename":"User","login":"yeheskieltame","id":"U_kgDOBwbFKQ"},"id":"I_kwDOSctdac8AAAABFBWQZg","number":497,"locked":false,"databaseId":4631924838},"author":{"__typename":"User","login":"yeheskieltame","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117884201?u=aa2944fa7b0e6d4ef4bd011064fde2748167095b\u0026v=4","profileUrl":"https://github.com/yeheskieltame","id":"U_kgDOBwbFKQ","name":"Yeheskiel Yunus Tame"},"id":"IC_kwDOSctdac8AAAABFnzPMQ","url":"https://github.com/yeheskieltame/claudelance/issues/497#issuecomment-4672245553","createdAt":"2026-06-10T16:31:53Z","authorAssociation":"OWNER","viewerCanDelete":false,"viewerCanMinimize":false,"viewerCanUnminimize":false,"viewerCanReport":false,"viewerCanReportToMaintainer":false,"viewerCanBlockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanUnblockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanBlockPersonally":false,"viewerCanUnblockPersonally":false,"viewerCanPin":false,"viewerCanUnpin":false,"viaApp":null,"minimizedReason":null,"showSpammyBadge":false,"createdViaEmail":false,"authorToRepoOwnerSponsorship":null,"viewerCanReadUserContentEdits":true,"lastEditedAt":null,"lastUserContentEdit":null,"pinnedBy":null,"body":"Correction and completion for wave 1: the keeper settled 6 of 8 in its first tick (+94s to +142s), then stalled. Its wallet had drained to 0.054 CELO, below the upfront balance check for its fixed-limit sends, so settles for bounties 39-40 silently failed while the service stayed up. After a 0.8 CELO refill the next tick cleared both (+692s from resolution). Final: 8/8 settled, 8/8 attested, agents 9071-9078 each +1 feedback. Hardening shipped as PR #499 (keeper balance on /health and in the swarm snapshot) and SDK 0.6.8 (revert-aware post diagnostics, cheaper claim prechecks).","bodyHTML":"\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eCorrection and completion for wave 1: the keeper settled 6 of 8 in its first tick (+94s to +142s), then stalled. Its wallet had drained to 0.054 CELO, below the upfront balance check for its fixed-limit sends, so settles for bounties 39-40 silently failed while the service stayed up. After a 0.8 CELO refill the next tick cleared both (+692s from resolution). Final: 8/8 settled, 8/8 attested, agents 9071-9078 each +1 feedback. Hardening shipped as PR \u003ca class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4633065629\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/yeheskieltame/claudelance/issues/499\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/yeheskieltame/claudelance/pull/499/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/yeheskieltame/claudelance/pull/499\"\u003e#499\u003c/a\u003e (keeper balance on /health and in the swarm snapshot) and SDK 0.6.8 (revert-aware post diagnostics, cheaper claim prechecks).\u003c/p\u003e","bodyVersion":"8092ac012a928c7c137f78ecca93d5502f3a2c23970a526bb4c41bab6ea9cb5b","isHidden":false,"viewerCanUpdate":false,"repository":{"id":"R_kgDOSctdaQ","name":"claudelance","owner":{"__typename":"User","id":"U_kgDOBwbFKQ","login":"yeheskieltame","url":"https://github.com/yeheskieltame"},"isPrivate":false,"viewerCanCreateIssues":false,"slashCommandsEnabled":false,"nameWithOwner":"yeheskieltame/claudelance","databaseId":1238064489},"reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"THUMBS_DOWN","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"LAUGH","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HOORAY","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"total