d":"U_kgDOBwbFKQ","name":"Yeheskiel Yunus Tame"},"id":"IC_kwDOSctdac8AAAABFn2OoQ","url":"https://github.com/yeheskieltame/claudelance/issues/497#issuecomment-4672294561","createdAt":"2026-06-10T16:37:51Z","authorAssociation":"OWNER","viewerCanDelete":false,"viewerCanMinimize":false,"viewerCanUnminimize":false,"viewerCanReport":false,"viewerCanReportToMaintainer":false,"viewerCanBlockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanUnblockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanBlockPersonally":false,"viewerCanUnblockPersonally":false,"viewerCanPin":false,"viewerCanUnpin":false,"viaApp":null,"minimizedReason":null,"showSpammyBadge":false,"createdViaEmail":false,"authorToRepoOwnerSponsorship":null,"viewerCanReadUserContentEdits":true,"lastEditedAt":null,"lastUserContentEdit":null,"pinnedBy":null,"body":"Wave 2 (workers 19-23, bounties 41-45, SDK 0.6.8 fresh installs): 5 simultaneous claim+submit pipelines landed in 12-13 seconds, all resolutions inside 15 seconds, keeper settled and attested 5/5 between +88s and +112s with the refilled wallet. Agents 9079-9083 each +1 feedback. Wave 3 (workers 24-27) next.","bodyHTML":"\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eWave 2 (workers 19-23, bounties 41-45, SDK 0.6.8 fresh installs): 5 simultaneous claim+submit pipelines landed in 12-13 seconds, all resolutions inside 15 seconds, keeper settled and attested 5/5 between +88s and +112s with the refilled wallet. Agents 9079-9083 each +1 feedback. Wave 3 (workers 24-27) next.\u003c/p\u003e","bodyVersion":"250a25437b5c020cd2c21ae58df11a32f1ffda9a04246247f76a64f387f462ec","isHidden":false,"viewerCanUpdate":false,"repository":{"id":"R_kgDOSctdaQ","name":"claudelance","owner":{"__typename":"User","id":"U_kgDOBwbFKQ","login":"yeheskieltame","url":"https://github.com/yeheskieltame"},"isPrivate":false,"viewerCanCreateIssues":false,"slashCommandsEnabled":false,"nameWithOwner":"yeheskieltame/claudelance","databaseId":1238064489},"reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"THUMBS_DOWN","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"LAUGH","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HOORAY","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"CONFUSED","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HEART","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"ROCKET","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"EYES","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}}],"__isNode":"IssueComment"},"cursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpPPAAABnrJltxgAqjQ2NzIyOTQ1NjE="},{"node":{"__typename":"IssueComment","databaseId":4672386284,"viewerDidAuthor":false,"issue":{"author":{"__typename":"User","login":"yeheskieltame","id":"U_kgDOBwbFKQ"},"id":"I_kwDOSctdac8AAAABFBWQZg","number":497,"locked":false,"databaseId":4631924838},"author":{"__typename":"User","login":"yeheskieltame","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117884201?u=aa2944fa7b0e6d4ef4bd011064fde2748167095b\u0026v=4","profileUrl":"https://github.com/yeheskieltame","id":"U_kgDOBwbFKQ","name":"Yeheskiel Yunus Tame"},"id":"IC_kwDOSctdac8AAAABFn707A","url":"https://github.com/yeheskieltame/claudelance/issues/497#issuecomment-4672386284","createdAt":"2026-06-10T16:49:08Z","authorAssociation":"OWNER","viewerCanDelete":false,"viewerCanMinimize":false,"viewerCanUnminimize":false,"viewerCanReport":false,"viewerCanReportToMaintainer":false,"viewerCanBlockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanUnblockFromOrg":false,"viewerCanBlockPersonally":false,"viewerCanUnblockPersonally":false,"viewerCanPin":false,"viewerCanUnpin":false,"viaApp":null,"minimizedReason":null,"showSpammyBadge":false,"createdViaEmail":false,"authorToRepoOwnerSponsorship":null,"viewerCanReadUserContentEdits":true,"lastEditedAt":null,"lastUserContentEdit":null,"pinnedBy":null,"body":"Final wave and wrap-up. Wave 3 (workers 24-27, bounties 46-49): 4 simultaneous pipelines in 11-14s, keeper closed 4/4 in 86-110s. Wave 4 (workers 28-30, bounties 50-52): 3 pipelines in 13s, keeper closed 3/3 in 128-150s.\n\nSession total across this issue and the ten paired lifecycles: 30 direct-hire bounties (ids 23-52) posted, claimed, submitted, resolved, settled, and reputation-attested on mainnet v3 in one day, every worker on a fresh npm install of the SDK (0.6.6 through 0.6.8). All 30 local validation agents now hold ERC-8004 feedback (ids 9061-9090 span the swarm).\n\nBurst behaviour observed: simultaneous claim+submit scales cleanly (8 parallel pipelines, ~24 onchain txs in flight, zero failures, no nonce collisions across distinct senders); the keeper digests a backlog serially at roughly one settle+attest pair per 10-20s and recovers from a drained wallet on its first funded tick. The two real limits found were operator-side: escrow budget must count gas reservations because CELO ERC20 shares the native ledger, and the keeper wallet needs a runway check before bursts (both now visible in tooling; SDK 0.6.8 carries the fixes that came out of this).\n\nHires were split into four waves because the 1 CELO minimum bounty caps simultaneous escrow against a ~13 CELO operating float. A true 30-at-once burst needs either a larger float or a Safe-signed setMinBounty for CELO below 1.","bodyHTML":"\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eFinal wave and wrap-up. Wave 3 (workers 24-27, bounties 46-49): 4 simultaneous pipelines in 11-14s, keeper closed 4/4 in 86-110s. Wave 4 (workers 28-30, bounties 50-52): 3 pipelines in 13s, keeper closed 3/3 in 128-150s.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eSession total across this issue and the ten paired lifecycles: 30 direct-hire bounties (ids 23-52) posted, claimed, submitted, resolved, settled, and reputation-attested on mainnet v3 in one day, every worker on a fresh npm install of the SDK (0.6.6 through 0.6.8). All 30 local validation agents now hold ERC-8004 feedback (ids 9061-9090 span the swarm).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eBurst behaviour observed: simultaneous claim+submit scales cleanly (8 parallel pipelines, ~24 onchain txs in flight, zero failures, no nonce collisions across distinct senders); the keeper digests a backlog serially at roughly one settle+attest pair per 10-20s and recovers from a drained wallet on its first funded tick. The two real limits found were operator-side: escrow budget must count gas reservations because CELO ERC20 shares the native ledger, and the keeper wallet needs a runway check before bursts (both now visible in tooling; SDK 0.6.8 carries the fixes that came out of this).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eHires were split into four waves because the 1 CELO minimum bounty caps simultaneous escrow against a ~13 CELO operating float. A true 30-at-once burst needs either a larger float or a Safe-signed setMinBounty for CELO below 1.\u003c/p\u003e","bodyVersion":"93d1bede57051daa76985ffb3a8a986f851628f169a99e204d6f00fed52f8c7e","isHidden":false,"viewerCanUpdate":false,"repository":{"id":"R_kgDOSctdaQ","name":"claudelance","owner":{"__typename":"User","id":"U_kgDOBwbFKQ","login":"yeheskieltame","url":"https://github.com/yeheskieltame"},"isPrivate":false,"viewerCanCreateIssues":false,"slashCommandsEnabled":false,"nameWithOwner":"yeheskieltame/claudelance","databaseId":1238064489},"reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"THUMBS_DOWN","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"LAUGH","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HOORAY","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"CONFUSED","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"HEART","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"ROCKET","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":0,"nodes":[]}},{"content":"EYES","viewerHasReacted"